      "title": "Boca do Rio — a village on wooden piles",
      "text": "A small pendant with two perforations was recovered in the central cluster of piles. Its stone is tremolite-actinolite nephrite, for which the study found no known source in Maranhão. The stone or finished pendant most likely came from elsewhere.",
